-entry-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["证据 B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["盯住新生儿黄疸的几个信号：出生 24 小时内就黄、叫不醒不吃奶，就当天去医院；越来越黄、大便发白，就尽快去查"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["八成以上的新生儿会有点黄。出生不满 24 小时就黄，或者黄的同时比平时嗜睡叫不醒、不吃奶、身子发软或发硬，要马上去医院。过了 24 小时越来越黄，或者大便颜色发白，也要尽快去查，大便发白可能是胆道闭锁。胆红素太高会伤到脑子，留下一辈子的残疾。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["挂号加测胆红素，几百元以内。要照蓝光的，一般在医院照两天左右。难在孩子看着还好的时候，也要跑这一趟"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["美国儿科学会 2022 年的指南说，「超过 80% 的新生儿会有某种程度的黄疸」。胆红素太高，会引起急性胆红素脑病和核黄疸。指南说核黄疸是「永久的致残性神经系统疾病」。它的表现包括手脚不自主扭动的脑瘫、眼睛往上看不了、乳牙釉质发育不良和听力损害。指南把「出生后 24 小时内出现黄疸」列为会发展成重度…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：盯住新生儿黄疸的几个信号：出生 24 小时内就黄、叫不醒不吃奶，就当天去医院；越来越黄、大便发白，就尽快去查"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["挂号加测胆红素，几百元以内。要照蓝光的，一般在医院照两天左右。难在孩子看着还好的时候，也要跑这一趟"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["美国儿科学会 2022 年的指南说，「超过 80% 的新生儿会有某种程度的黄疸」。胆红素太高，会引起急性胆红素脑病和核黄疸。指南说核黄疸是「永久的致残性神经系统疾病」。它的表现包括手脚不自主扭动的脑瘫、眼睛往上看不了、乳牙釉质发育不良和听力损害。指南把「出生后 24 小时内出现黄疸」列为会发展成重度黄疸的风险因素。英国国家医疗服务体系（NHS）给家长的说法分两档。第一档要打急救电话或直接去急诊。这一档是孩子有黄疸，同时比平时嗜睡或叫不醒、不吃奶、身子发软或发硬、有抽动。孩子出生还不满 24 小时就有黄疸的，也算这一档。第二档要尽快约医生。这一档是出生超过 24 小时，黄疸不见好或越来越重，尿深黄或褐色，或者大便是淡奶油色。全球估算，2010 年约 48 万名新生儿得了 Rh 溶血病（母子血型不合引起）或极重度的高胆红素血症。这些孩子里 24% 死亡，13% 发展成核黄疸。核黄疸活下来的孩子里，83% 以上留下一种或多种残损。大便发白可能是胆道闭锁，这种病要在 60 天内做葛西手术（Kasai 手术），治疗结果才明显更好。台湾从 2004 年起，把大便比色卡印进每个新生儿的儿童健康手册。60 天内做上手术的比例，从 2004 年的 60% 升到 2005 年的 74.3%。另一项台湾全民研究里，推行比色卡之后，胆道闭锁孩子的死亡率从 26.2% 降到 15.9%。这是前后对比，不是分组试验"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Kemper AR, Newman TB, Slaughter JL, et al. (2022). Clinical Practice Guideline Revision: Management of Hyperbilirubinemia in the Newborn Infant 35 or More Weeks of Gestation. Pediatrics, 150(3), e2022058859. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2022-058859","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2022-058859"]},"；NHS. Jaundice in babies（2026-03-24 审阅）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/jaundice-newborn/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/jaundice-newborn/"]},"；NICE (2010, 2023 修订). Jaundice in newborn babies under 28 days (CG98), 1.2.6、1.7.1. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg98/chapter/Recommendations","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg98/chapter/Recommendations"]},"；Bhutani VK, Zipursky A, Blencowe H, et al. (2013). Neonatal hyperbilirubinemia and Rhesus disease of the newborn: incidence and impairment estimates for 2010 at regional and global levels. Pediatric Research, 74(Suppl 1), 86-100. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/pr.2013.208","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/pr.2013.208"]},"；Hsiao CH, Chang MH, Chen HL, et al. (2008). Universal screening for biliary atresia using an infant stool color card in Taiwan. Hepatology, 47(4), 1233-1240. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/hep.22182","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/hep.22182"]},"；Lee M, Chen SC, Yang HY, et al. (2016). Infant Stool Color Card Screening Helps Reduce the Hospitalization Rate and Mortality of Biliary Atresia: A 14-Year Nationwide Cohort Study in Taiwan. Medicine, 95(12), e3166. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1097/MD.0000000000003166","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1097/MD.0000000000003166"]},"；国家卫生计生委 (2017). 国家基本公共卫生服务规范（第三版），0～6 岁儿童健康管理服务规范. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhc.gov.cn/ewebeditor/uploadfile/2017/04/20170417104506514.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhc.gov.cn/ewebeditor/uploadfile/2017/04/20170417104506514.pdf"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["照蓝光（光照治疗）是用特殊的光照孩子的皮肤，让胆红素变成容易排出去的形式。别在家晒太阳代替：美国儿科学会说，晒太阳很难做到既安全又不晒伤，所以不推荐拿它当治疗。也别喂水或葡萄糖水来退黄，这个指南也明确不推荐。肉眼看黄的深浅，估不准胆红素有多高。英国 NICE 指南写明不要只靠肉眼，拿不准就去测一次。不满 38 周出生、哥哥姐姐照过蓝光、母乳没吃够的孩子，更容易黄得重。复查按国家基本公共卫生服务规范走：出院后 1 周内，医务人员上门访视。出生后 28 到 30 天，到社区卫生服务中心或乡镇卫生院随访。两次都要看黄疸。出院时医生另约了复查胆红素的，按约的时间去。足月的孩子黄了超过 14 天，早产的超过 21 天，NICE 指南要求查一次结合胆红素，并看大便是不是发白。黄疸本身不耽误打疫苗，见本节第 3 条（疫苗）。新生儿筛查见第 27 节第 13 条（足跟血筛查）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/20-12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"孩子有严重湿疹或鸡蛋过敏，别躲着花生，按医生指导早点加上，但绝不能喂整粒"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/20-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"怀孕、喂奶时在吃素，就补维生素 B12 或吃强化食品；孩子的辅食要有动物性食物，非要全素先找医生"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 1 岁不喂蜂蜜"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 1 岁，不要喂蜂蜜。蜂蜜水、拌进辅食里的蜂蜜、含蜂蜜的糕点，都算。蜂蜜里可能带有引起肉毒中毒的细菌。大人肚子里的菌群能压住它，婴儿压不住。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出生时的维生素 K 针一定要打"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["新生儿身体里存的维生素 K 很少，不补可能出血，晚出现的那种常常是脑子里出血。塔什干没普遍做这种预防，每 10 万个新生儿有 478 个出这种血。做了预防，估计…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 3 个月的婴儿体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院，不在家观察"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 3 个月，体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院。不要在家观察，也不要先喂退烧药再等等看。美国儿科学会专门给看着状态还可以的发热婴儿定了处理办法，所以「看着精…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["无论多累多气都不要摇晃婴儿"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["婴儿的头大，脖子没力气。用力摇晃会让他脑子里、眼睛里出血，可能要了他的命，也可能留下一辈子的残疾。哄睡时轻轻晃不算，危险的是控制不住的猛晃。快压不住火时，把孩子…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["尿布不看牌子看三件事：合不合身、换得勤不勤、有没有被抽检通报过"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没有哪个官方机构排过「哪个牌子最好」。能查的只有两样：市场监管总局的产品质量抽检通报，和监管部门对具体事件的调查。贵的不等于安全，进口的不等于合格。先买小包装试…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["大件按「借、买二手、买新」的顺序考虑，别一次性配齐"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["婴儿车、抱被、玩具用得短，先借，借不到买二手，最后才买新的。二手安全座椅要确认没出过较重的车祸、没被召回、零件齐全，确认不了就别用。苏格兰一项研究里，平时睡别的…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href